From: =?UTF-8?q?=C3=81ngel=20Ren=C3=A9?=
 <17342133+angelrenefm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 19:05:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: google: gs201-panther: reboot=warm, so
 reboot-to reaches fastboot
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A cold PSCI reset loses the reboot mode the kernel writes for the
bootloader, so "reboot-to bootloader" boots slot B again. With
/sys/kernel/reboot/mode set to warm at runtime, the Pixel 7 reached
fastboot 3 times out of 3 (about 33 s each); a cold control booted
Linux again (0 of 1). husky carries the same option in its bootargs.

Booted with this line (/proc/cmdline has reboot=warm, and
/sys/kernel/reboot/mode reads warm), with nothing written by hand:
- reboot-to bootloader: fastboot, three times;
- an ordinary reboot: back to Linux on slot B;
- a panic (echo c > /proc/sysrq-trigger, with panic=10): reset, and
  back to Linux on slot B, the reset spending one of slot B's boot
  tries (devinfo retry count 2 to 1), as the initramfs's no-USB-host
  panic relies on.

Every reboot now becomes a warm reset, which leaves the PMIC rails
powered. On the Pixel 7 Pro that hid the accelerometer after a warm
reboot until the AoC start power-cycled the sensor rails; on the
Pixel 7 the sensor proxy still found the accelerometer, light and
proximity sensors after these warm resets.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ángel René <17342133+angelrenefm@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs201-panther.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs201-panther.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs201-panther.dts
index b4a13e17a..7e1640a9b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs201-panther.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs201-panther.dts
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@ / {
 
 	chosen {
 		/* ABL requires bootargs to exist; it appends its own after these. */
-		bootargs = "console=tty0 panic=10 clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused rdinit=/init omamobile.ufs-probe mem_sleep_default=s2idle";
+		bootargs = "console=tty0 panic=10 reboot=warm clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused rdinit=/init omamobile.ufs-probe mem_sleep_default=s2idle";
 		#address-cells = <2>;
 		#size-cells = <1>;
 		ranges;
